### Get all expenses
GET http://localhost:3000/expenses

###

### Create an expense - Dinner paid by Alice (id: 1), split between all three
POST http://localhost:3000/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dinner",
  "amount": 60,
  "paidByParticipantId": 1,
  "participantIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

###

### Create an expense - Taxi paid by Bob (id: 2), split between Bob and Charlie
POST http://localhost:3000/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Taxi",
  "amount": 30,
  "paidByParticipantId": 2,
  "participantIds": [2, 3]
}

###

### Get balances
GET http://localhost:3000/balances
